WEBVTT

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.631
(Manny exhales)
如果那只翼指龙不飞

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:10.343
BUCK:
♪ And if that pterodactyl don't fly ♪
如果那只翼指龙不飞

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:13.763
♪ Daddy's gonna blind his remaining eye ♪
爸爸剩下的眼睛也要瞎了

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:16.224
(yawns)

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.854
Sweet dreams, little one.
做个好梦，小家伙

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.191
(sighs) Lucky pumpkin!
命好的南瓜！有个有爱的爸爸肯定很幸福

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.485
It must be nice to have a loving father.
命好的南瓜！有个有爱的爸爸肯定很幸福

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:27.611
Whoo.
好吧，来吧，你行的，罗杰

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.780
Okay, here we go. You can do this, Roger.
好吧，来吧，你行的，罗杰

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.742
(chuckles) Yay! Kidnapping!
耶！绑架！

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.329
Look I'm sorry. It's not me.
对不起，不怪我，我不会做这种事的

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.622
I would never do something like this.
对不起，不怪我，我不会做这种事的

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.166
It's my father. He's crazy.
是我爸爸的主意，他很吓人

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:43.376
I can't believe he pulled it off!
真不敢相信他居然成功了！

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.170
Way to go, dum-dum!
加油，笨笨！

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:46.671
Oh. Thanks, Dad.
谢谢，爸爸

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:49.174
Whatever! I could've done the same thing.
有什么的！我也能干

00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:50.926
(groans)

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.345
Well, well.
好吧，好吧

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.014
Looks like you're not
stopping that asteroid now,
看来你不能去阻止行星了
对吗，黄鼠狼？

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.307
are you, weasel?
看来你不能去阻止行星了
对吗，黄鼠狼？

00:00:58.225 --> 00:00:59.226
-(snoring)
-Huh?
这不是黄鼠狼，这是…

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.352
That's not the weasel. That's...
这不是黄鼠狼，这是…

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.394
(yawns)
我不知道这是什么

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:03.605
-I don't know what that is.
-Hmm.
我不知道这是什么

00:01:03.939 --> 00:01:04.940
Whoa!

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.944
Is it my time, angel?
我到时候了，天使？

00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:10.612
Time for what?
什么时候？

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.948
(gasps) I'm coming to the light.
我要去转世

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:16.535
Can't wait to see all those
dead relatives I hate.
真想马上看到那些我厌恶的死人

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.578
Ahh! Get it off! Get it off! Get it off!
下去！下去！下去！

00:01:18.954 --> 00:01:21.623
-Go help your sister.
-But, Dad... (screams)
–去帮帮你妹妹
–可，爸爸…

00:01:22.123 --> 00:01:23.583
Ahh! Demon angel!
恶魔天使！

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.002
(groaning)
跟奶奶捣蛋，打你屁屁

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.713
Mess with Granny,
get knocked on your fanny.
跟奶奶捣蛋，打你屁屁

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:29.923
(groans)

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.424
(screams)

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.551
(gulps)
应该这么办

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:36.096
And that's how it's done. Hmm.
应该这么办

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:38.682
GRANNY: Hello? Angel?
你好？天使？

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.016
Am I in heaven?
我在天堂吗？

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.227
It's so dark and squishy in here.
这里好黑，黏糊糊的

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:43.353
Huh?
哦，不！我还是能看到光

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.064
Oh, no! I can still see the light.
哦，不！我还是能看到光

00:01:46.147 --> 00:01:48.441
-(gasps)
-(both grunting)

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:49.568
Ow!

00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:50.652
(screaming)

00:01:50.986 --> 00:01:52.779
(groaning)
爸爸！我来救你

00:01:52.862 --> 00:01:54.906
Pop! I'll save you.
爸爸！我来救你

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.741
(both grunting)

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:58.785
Whee!

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:02.247
Hello!
嗨！

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.415
(all screaming)

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:04.499
(groans)

00:02:07.335 --> 00:02:09.254
Oh, well. Probably for the best.
好吧，这样可能最好

00:02:09.337 --> 00:02:10.714
-Yeah, probably.
-Definitely.
–可能
–当然

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:17.512
(smacking lips)

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:19.973
(Buck gasps)

00:02:21.891 --> 00:02:22.934
(gasps)
天哪！

00:02:23.018 --> 00:02:24.019
Crikey!
天哪！

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.480
Mmm. (gasps)
我的天，巴克，你干了什么？

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:30.483
Good gravy, Buck. What have you done?
我的天，巴克，你干了什么？

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:32.652
All right, mammals. Time to get moving.
好吧，哺乳动物们，该出发了

00:02:32.736 --> 00:02:35.113
Now let's not linger on this, but, yes...
别逗留了，可是，没错…

00:02:35.196 --> 00:02:38.408
I read the tablet wrong.
The asteroid is a lot closer.
碑上的内容我理解错了，行星很近了

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:43.288
Uh-oh.
等等，奶奶去哪了？

00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:45.290
Wait a second. Where's Granny?
等等，奶奶去哪了？

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:48.293
-Oh.
-Granny? Oh, Granny?
奶奶？奶奶？

00:02:48.376 --> 00:02:49.794
Maybe she wandered off?
她散步去了吧？

00:02:49.878 --> 00:02:51.755
Maybe she got hit in the head with a puck?
也许被冰球打到头了？

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.340
Yes! And maybe she was abducted
对了！也许那些9米高的
残暴的恐龙鸟把她抓走了…

00:02:53.423 --> 00:02:55.175
by homicidal 30-foot dino-birds
对了！也许那些9米高的
残暴的恐龙鸟把她抓走了…

00:02:55.258 --> 00:02:56.801
seeking revenge on me.
他们在找我寻仇

00:02:56.885 --> 00:02:59.888
All good theories.
I'm going to go with the puck.
这些观点都不错，我同意冰球的那个

00:03:01.097 --> 00:03:02.599
DIEGO: I knew it!
我就知道！

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:05.685
So this whole time we've been
chased by giant dino-birds?
所以我们一直被巨大的恐龙鸟追？

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:09.147
Oh, only three! I didn't want
to damage morale.
哦，只有三只！我不想毁士气

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.315
Right. Because before this,
没错，因为在这之前
我们在无忧无虑地航行

00:03:10.398 --> 00:03:12.359
we were on a carefree pleasure cruise.
没错，因为在这之前
我们在无忧无虑地航行

00:03:12.442 --> 00:03:13.985
DIEGO: Wait a second. (sniffs)
等等

00:03:14.069 --> 00:03:16.363
I've got her scent. Come on!
我闻到她的味道了，来！

00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:19.407
(sniffing)

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:26.539
Whoa!

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:31.336
BUCK: Mammals, we've made it!
哺乳动物们，我们到了！

00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:33.004
The crash site.
撞击点，这肯定是之前的行星留下的

00:03:33.088 --> 00:03:35.590
This must be what's left
of the previous asteroid.
撞击点，这肯定是之前的行星留下的

00:03:36.257 --> 00:03:39.386
Uh, Buck? Your space rocks!
巴克？你的宇宙石！

00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:44.683
We could definitely divert the asteroid
with a magnet that size!
我们可以用那个尺寸的吸铁石
转移行星！

00:03:44.766 --> 00:03:46.518
I mean that thing is enormous.
我是说那块很大

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:47.852
It's massive, it's...
超大，它…

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:50.313
...going to be impossible
to get off the ground.
不可能离开地面

00:03:50.397 --> 00:03:51.856
It's entirely possible.
这完全有可能

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.693
In a way that we don't know about yet.
只是我们现在还没想到办法

00:03:54.776 --> 00:03:56.486
But what about the dino-birds?
可是恐龙鸟儿怎么办？

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:57.862
And what about Granny?
奶奶呢？

00:03:57.946 --> 00:03:58.947
(sniffs)
奶奶呢？

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.031
(sighs) Nothing.
没有味道了

00:04:02.117 --> 00:04:04.202
-I'm sorry, Sid.
-(sniffles)
我很难过，希德

00:04:04.285 --> 00:04:08.790
Oh, Granny. My sweet, malicious Granny.
哦，奶奶，亲爱的，恶毒的奶奶

00:04:09.124 --> 00:04:12.544
Why does it always have to be
the old ones who go first?
为什么先走的总是年纪最大的？

00:04:12.627 --> 00:04:13.712
Why?
为什么？

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:14.754
(sobbing)

00:04:14.838 --> 00:04:16.214
(distant shrieking)
我还能听到她甜美、刺耳的声音…

00:04:16.297 --> 00:04:19.259
I can still hear her sweet, shrill voice
我还能听到她甜美、刺耳的声音…

00:04:19.342 --> 00:04:21.511
shrieking from the afterlife.
转世后的尖叫声

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:23.388
(shrieking continues)
奶奶活着！

00:04:23.471 --> 00:04:24.597
Granny's alive!
奶奶活着！

00:04:24.681 --> 00:04:25.765
And she's in trouble!
她遇到麻烦了！

00:04:33.398 --> 00:04:34.858
Granny?
奶奶？

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.860
-Granny?
-Granny?
–奶奶？
–奶奶？

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:38.319
(distant screaming)

00:04:43.241 --> 00:04:44.909
(both gasp)

00:04:44.993 --> 00:04:46.494
(moaning)

00:04:48.455 --> 00:04:49.914
Is she okay?
她没事吧？

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:51.791
Uh, I'm not sure.
我不确定

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:53.126
(continues moaning)

00:04:56.463 --> 00:04:58.089
Unhand my Granny!
把我奶奶交出来！

00:04:58.173 --> 00:05:00.175
You do and you don't get a tip.
你要是照做，就拿不到小费了！

00:05:00.258 --> 00:05:02.093
Making this beautiful sloth happy
我要的报酬只是让这位美丽的树獭开心

00:05:02.177 --> 00:05:03.887
is all the payment I need.
我要的报酬只是让这位美丽的树獭开心

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.556
You see? Hunky bunny gets it.
明白没？性感的兔子全都明白

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:07.891
Granny!
奶奶！

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:10.769
There's a bunny living in the asteroid?
小行星里住了只兔子？真是意想不到

00:05:10.852 --> 00:05:12.228
Did not see that coming.
小行星里住了只兔子？真是意想不到

00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:14.689
Wait till you see this!
你先看看这个吧！

